303
00:19:31,040 --> 00:19:32,680
It was partly his idea.

304
00:19:32,720 --> 00:19:35,560
Oh, my... God.

305
00:19:35,600 --> 00:19:39,000
- I'm going to beat the sh... - No! No!

306
00:19:39,040 --> 00:19:40,920
Oh, come on, come on,

307
00:19:40,960 --> 00:19:43,600
we've got the band back together again!

308
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:46,480
Now, lovely as it is to have you on board,

309
