319
00:20:24,680 --> 00:20:28,920
We could have snuck back in, but the Doctor being the Doctor...

320
00:20:55,320 --> 00:20:57,440
By the time we got back to the university,

321
00:20:57,440 --> 00:20:59,720
the Monks were waiting for us...

322
