We weren't headed to his office, though.

324
00:21:14,160 --> 00:21:18,040
Even so, the Doctor was nervous, Mum. I could tell.

325
00:21:18,040 --> 00:21:20,480
He had to do this, he said.

326
00:21:20,480 --> 00:21:22,840
He had to open the vault.

327
00:21:22,840 --> 00:21:25,680
Move into the containment field, please.

328
00:21:58,520 --> 00:22:00,400
But it's...

329
00:22:00,400 --> 00:22:02,520
It's just a woman.

330
00:22:03,760 --> 00:22:06,120
The way you and Nardole have been carrying on,

331
00:22:06,120 --> 00:22:07,840
I thought you had a monster in here, or something!

332
00:22:07,880 --> 00:22:08,880
I do.

333
00:22:09,360 --> 00:22:10,960
Missy...

334
00:22:11,800 --> 00:22:12,520
Bill.

335
00:22:12,520 --> 00:22:14,080
Bill, Missy,

336
00:22:14,080 --> 00:22:15,840
the other Last of the Time Lords.

337
00:22:18,880 --> 00:22:20,640
Wait a sec.

338
00:22:20,640 --> 00:22:22,600
Why have you got a woman locked in a vault?

339
00:22:22,600 --> 00:22:25,400
Because even I think that's weird, and I've been attacked by a puddle.

340
00:22:25,400 --> 00:22:28,520
She's going cold turkey from being bad.

341
00:22:28,520 --> 00:22:31,320
I want to ask if you've had any dealings with the Monks before.

342
00:22:31,320 --> 00:22:33,760
Of course! I've had adventures too.

343
00:22:33,760 --> 00:22:37,120
My whole life doesn't revolve around you, you know?

344
00:22:37,120 --> 00:22:39,160
- Did you defeat them? - I did.

345
00:22:39,880 --> 00:22:40,880
How?

346
00:22:44,240 --> 00:22:46,400
I've got some requests.

347
00:22:46,400 --> 00:22:49,080
I want some new books, some toys,

348
00:22:49,080 --> 00:22:50,600
like a particle accelerator,

349
00:22:50,600 --> 00:22:53,680
a 3-D printer and a pony.

350
00:22:53,680 --> 00:22:57,720
I don't think that you really grasp what's going on here.

351
00:22:58,720 --> 00:23:02,000
Nice people generally don't haggle over the fate of a planet.

352
00:23:02,040 --> 00:23:05,000
I once built a gun out of leaves.

353
00:23:05,000 --> 00:23:07,920
Do you think I couldn't get through a door if I wanted to?

354
00:23:09,280 --> 00:23:12,440
I'm here, all right? I'm engaging with the process.

355
00:23:13,480 --> 00:23:17,640
Okay, yeah, we can get those things for you.

356
00:23:17,680 --> 00:23:19,280
C'est super!

357
00:23:21,760 --> 00:23:25,640
So, what have you got so far?

358
00:23:27,080 --> 00:23:29,120
They hold on to power by targeting the part of the brain

359
00:23:29,160 --> 00:23:33,800
specifically to do with memory and perception, correct? Right?

360
00:23:33,840 --> 00:23:36,360
Getting warm. Fingers tingling.

361
00:23:36,400 --> 00:23:40,920
But they target it with what exactly? How do they sustain it?

362
00:23:40,960 --> 00:23:45,640
How do their lies infiltrate the brains of billions?

363
00:23:45,680 --> 00:23:48,120
Is it some kind of airborne psychoactive?

364
00:23:48,160 --> 00:23:50,160
No, no, that's very cold, very cold.

365
00:23:50,200 --> 00:23:53,320
Something that's constantly being fed to the populace,

366
00:23:53,360 --> 00:23:55,640
constantly consolidating its hold. Is it in the water?

367
00:23:55,680 --> 00:23:59,680
God, no. It's freezing, freezing, absolutely freezing.

368
00:23:59,720 --> 00:24:02,480
Couldn't be colder, very, very, chilly, so, so chilly.

369
00:24:02,520 --> 00:24:03,560
Oh, come on.

370
00:24:04,720 --> 00:24:08,080
I'm bored! You haven't been to see me in six months.

371
00:24:08,120 --> 00:24:09,640
No-one has!

372
00:24:09,680 --> 00:24:11,880
Not even that bald bloke who looks like an egg!

373
00:24:11,920 --> 00:24:14,000
You left her alone in here for six months?!

374
00:24:14,040 --> 00:24:15,440
I was in prison for six months!

375
00:24:15,480 --> 00:24:17,400
Start at the beginning.

376
00:24:17,440 --> 00:24:19,560
How do they get a foothold on a planet?

377
00:24:19,600 --> 00:24:21,440
Some idiot asks for their help.

378
