380
00:24:26,360 --> 00:24:30,320
A pure request, one without agenda or ulterior motive.

381
00:24:34,760 --> 00:24:36,560
It's them.

382
00:24:36,600 --> 00:24:39,040
That person creates a psychic link,

383
00:24:39,080 --> 00:24:41,880
