The statues!

389
00:24:52,560 --> 00:24:56,120
As soon as they got here, the Monks put up statues!

390
00:24:56,160 --> 00:24:59,520
In every town square, in every park and every playground!

391
00:24:59,560 --> 00:25:02,600
You're on fire, you're literally on fire you're so caliente.

392
00:25:02,640 --> 00:25:03,800
That's Spanish for "hot".

393
00:25:03,840 --> 00:25:06,160
The statues are transmitters!

394
00:25:06,200 --> 00:25:09,240
They boost the signal and beam it out all around the world!

395
00:25:09,280 --> 00:25:11,480
Boom! You've exploded.

396
00:25:11,520 --> 00:25:14,280
Now, all you have to do is find whoever opened the door to

397
00:25:14,320 --> 00:25:17,320
- the Monks in the first place. - Say I already have.

398
00:25:17,360 --> 00:25:19,200
Oh, well, then you're sorted.

399
00:25:19,240 --> 00:25:23,600
Just kill them. That weakens the Monks' grip on the world.

400
00:25:27,960 --> 00:25:30,680
No, no, no, that can't be right.

401
00:25:30,720 --> 00:25:33,560
There are planets that the Monks have ruled for thousands of years.

402
00:25:33,600 --> 00:25:35,880
It's passed on through the bloodline.

403
00:25:35,920 --> 00:25:39,240
Usually the lynchpin goes on to lead a normal life, have their

404
00:25:39,280 --> 00:25:42,440
own family, and the link is passed down through the generations.

405
00:25:42,480 --> 00:25:44,360
But the Monks must have worked that out.

406
00:25:44,400 --> 00:25:46,560
- They've been doing this for millennia. - Why?

407
00:25:46,600 --> 00:25:49,600
If the link is passed on, the Monks stay in charge through,

408
00:25:49,640 --> 00:25:52,720
they think, their ruthlessness and efficiency.

409
00:25:52,760 --> 00:25:55,960
But if the lynchpin dies and the link isn't passed on and the

410
00:25:56,000 --> 00:25:59,720
Monks get booted off the planet, they just chalk it up to experience.

411
00:26:06,400 --> 00:26:07,440
No, it's okay.

412
00:26:09,480 --> 00:26:11,120
I want to speak to her.

413
00:26:11,160 --> 00:26:12,080
Yes?

414
00:26:12,080 --> 00:26:14,920
So when you defeated the Monks, that's how you did it?

415
00:26:14,960 --> 00:26:17,880
Well, at this point, all that was left of the bloodline

416
00:26:17,920 --> 00:26:21,080
was a wee girl, and I just pushed her into a volcano.

417
00:26:22,560 --> 00:26:25,400
It's me. The lynchpin is me.

418
00:26:26,840 --> 00:26:29,640
Awwwk-waaard...

419
00:26:29,680 --> 00:26:31,120
So you're saying I have to die.

420
00:26:31,160 --> 00:26:32,520
No. If you were just to die,

421
00:26:32,560 --> 00:26:35,000
everyone's false memories would have to fade,

422
00:26:35,040 --> 00:26:36,560
and that could take ages.

423
00:26:36,600 --> 00:26:38,760
It's actually better if you keep breathing,

424
00:26:38,800 --> 00:26:41,080
if your brain just keeps transmitting...

425
00:26:41,120 --> 00:26:45,920
well, nothing. That would blot out the residue false memories.

426
00:26:45,960 --> 00:26:47,560
What would be left of me?

427
00:26:47,600 --> 00:26:52,040
You'd be a husk. Completely and irrevocably brain-dead.

428
00:26:52,080 --> 00:26:55,200
You couldn't even get on Celebrity Love Island.

429
00:26:55,240 --> 00:26:58,080
Even if that was the truth, the fact that you're suggesting it

430
00:26:58,120 --> 00:27:02,200
shows there's been no change, no hope, no point.

431
00:27:02,240 --> 00:27:06,200
We don't sacrifice people. It's wrong... because it's easy.

