How many Monks were there?

480
00:30:18,840 --> 00:30:21,120
- About 12 Monks there. - 12?

481
00:30:28,560 --> 00:30:30,720
Well, you have to admit, that's ever so clever.

482
00:30:30,720 --> 00:30:35,200
You see? Another way they hang on to power is to create a myth

483
00:30:35,200 --> 00:30:39,040
